Description: GNOME-native starting point for a Linux workday
 Workspace Hub gives non-technical users a calm starting point for desktop
 applications, web apps, files, shared locations, workspace status and support.
 .
 This native package uses the GTK 4 and libadwaita libraries supplied by the
 host distribution, allowing supported desktop colour schemes to be applied.
